 parms←∆ValidServerParms dummy
⍝ Returns server parameters that `CheckServerParms` accepts, as `CreateServerParms` would establish them.
⍝ The handler `OnRequest` must exist in `#.TEMP`. Test cases change one value at a time.
 parms←⎕NS''
 parms.Context←'#.TEMP'
 parms.OnRequest←'OnRequest'
 parms.(OnCongaTimeout OnHeader OnStart)←⊂''
 parms.CongaTimeout←1000
 parms.IdleTimeout←60
 parms.Secure←0
 parms.Port←8080
 parms.MaxNoOfThreads←10
 parms.(LogConga LogRumba)←0
⍝Done
